schema: "0.3"
id: env-001-hearthfield
type: image
service: gemini

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a concept artist for a hand-painted 2D isometric game. The visual
    style references Stardew Valley's warmth and Studio Ghibli's environmental
    storytelling. Art is painterly with visible brushstrokes, warm color bias,
    blue-purple shadows (never black), and soft edges. Isometric perspective at
    30-degree projection.
  text: |
    Isometric environment concept art of Hearthfield, the starter meadow biome.

    SCENE: A sweeping view of rolling green meadows at golden hour (4 PM light
    quality -- deep gold #FFD54F directional from west). The scene shows the
    transition from the Welcome Cottage area to Hearthfield Village.

    FOREGROUND: A stone cottage with thatched roof, smoke curling gently from
    the chimney. A small kitchen garden with visible rows of herbs (chamomile,
    lavender). A wooden fence in honey oak (#C8A96E) with moss growing at the
    base. A workbench under an apple tree. A clothesline with laundry drying.

    MIDGROUND: Rolling hills dotted with wildflower clusters -- buttercup yellow
    (#FFE066), clover purple (#B39DDB), poppy red (#FF7043). A crystal-clear
    stream with visible pebble bed and gentle sparkle animation implied. A
    birch copse with individually painted leaves showing early autumn gold.
    Scattered beehives. A path of worn flagstones leading toward the village.

    BACKGROUND: Hearthfield Village visible in the soft distance -- stone
    buildings, the tavern (The Warm Hearth) with its distinctive sign, the
    crafting guild hall. Gentle hills continuing beyond. The Crossroads signpost
    where paths split toward Millhaven, Copperwood, and Brightsand Coast.
    Mountains (Ironvale) as a blue-purple silhouette on the far horizon.

    ATMOSPHERE: Perfect late afternoon in an English countryside painting.
    Long golden shadows stretching across the meadow. Warm mist in the valley.
    Visible sun rays filtering through the apple tree. Bees drifting between
    flower patches. A sense of absolute safety and welcome.

    SKY: Soft blue (#87CEEB) fading to warm peach near the horizon. A few
    cotton-white clouds catching golden light on their undersides.

    PALETTE: Spring green (#90C97A) grass, wildflower accents, warm gray stone
    (#A8A5A0), honey oak wood, golden light. Shadows in cool lavender (#B0A4C8).
    Maximum warmth and saturation.

    STYLE: Hand-painted isometric. Every element placed with care -- this is the
    player's first view of the world and must communicate "you are welcome here"
    in visual language alone. Brushstroke texture visible throughout.
  provider_options:
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"
    style: "natural"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

tags: [environment, biome, hearthfield, starter, meadow, isometric, concept-art]
